stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  state "VALID" as V
  state "SUSPENDED<br/>reason: SCIM deactivation" as SS
  state "SUSPENDED<br/>other reason (fraud, issuer)" as SO
  state "INVALID" as I
  [*] --> V: issued
  V --> SS: deactivate (type follows account)
  SS --> V: reactivate
  V --> SO: issuer decision
  SO --> I: issuer decision
  V --> I: delete or dependent claim change<br/>(per type policy)
  SS --> I: delete (per type policy)
  I --> [*]
  note right of SO
    reactivation never
    clears this state
  end note
